/-- Top piece 41 after a borrow, building a wall: turn: 0^inf 2*x0 1 2*x1+4 0 2*x2+1 1 1 0 2*x3+4 0 2*x4+2  ->  0^inf 2*x0+4*x3+10 1 2*x1+1 1 2*x2+7 1 2*x4+2. -/
theorem top_41 (x0 x1 x2 x3 x4 : Nat) (c d : Nat) (zs : List (Nat × Nat)) :
